      "source": "citation",
      "value": "2025-04-05",
      "detail": "https://holbrookma.gov/228/Elections-Voting",
      "quote": "2025 4.5 certified Annual Town Elec Results",
      "note": "SUPPLY, not confirm: the record asserts no date at all. The certified return was fetched (DocumentCenter 947, 3 pages, image-only, OCRs to 6999 chars) and its tallies are identical to the parse we hold - Lade 200, Morse 160, Schaar 345 - so it is the same document, and it truly prints no date: the heading is TOWN OF HOLBROOK ANNUAL TOWN ELECTION and it closes A true copy Attest Jeanmarie Tarara Holbrook Town Clerk. The day comes from the towns own Elections and Voting index, which names this exact file 2025 4.5 certified Annual Town Elec Results and lists its four precinct ballots as Pr 1 ballott 4.5.25 through Pr 4 ballott 4.5.25, fixing 4.5 as month.day. Holbrook votes the first Saturday in April and the series on that page is unbroken: April 6 2024, 2025 4.5, 26 4.4 - all Saturdays."
    }
